  "description": "An IAx25Transport whose modem IS the radio: no external TNC. Puts a Tait TM8100/TM8200 into Transparent mode (its internal FFSK modem as an 8-bit-clean byte pipe), frames AX.25 with KISS SLIP over that pipe, and de-frames inbound bytes back into whole frames. Because it owns the transmission it times it directly, so it implements ITxCompletionTransport and stamps per-frame on-air start/end and airtime. Builds on M0LTE.Radio.Tait. Source: github.com/packet-net/packet.net.",
